# Documentation
# Phase 1a (live collect) for two_phase IR. KapeIR.Triage then runs Phase 1b
# (Phase1_MemoryTriage + Phase1_MemoryDeep) against Phase1_Volatile when a dump exists.
#
# Requires signed go-winpmem as Modules\bin\winpmem.exe (see Velocidex_WinPmem.mkape).
# Live console modules may use Modules\bin\Invoke-Utf8Capture.ps1.
# Without RAM: Phase1_VolatileFirst_NoMemory.mkape / --skip-memory.
#
# Example:
#   kape.exe --msource C: --mdest D:\evidence\Phase1_Volatile --module Phase1_VolatileFirst
